Package: revlitquery
Type: Package
Title: Reverse Literature Review Search Query Optimizer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pascal", "Crepey", email = "pascal.crepey@ehesp.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discovers and optimizes semantically equivalent 'PubMed'
    <https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/> and 'Google Scholar'
    <https://scholar.google.com/> (up to 256 characters) boolean search
    queries from a seed corpus of 'BibTeX' references. Combines morphological
    prefix wildcard synthesis, concept block discovery, timeline-stratified
    exclusion concept mining, and live 'NCBI' E-utilities evaluation across the
    sensitivity-specificity Pareto frontier. Includes an interactive 'Shiny'
    dashboard and command-line workflow.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/PascalCrepey/revlitquery,
    https://pascalcrepey.github.io/revlitquery/
